cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Citable artifact. Update the DOI and repository URL upon acceptance."
title: "Validity Gates for Fault-Injection Protocols in Robot Learning Simulations"
abstract: >-
  Companion artifacts: executable validity gates (injection P1 / measurement P2 /
  convergence P3), a 66-item CPU-only self-check suite, the static audit tool and raw
  audit data for 30 public repositories, and mutation-testing data for 21 semantic
  mutants. Every headline number is recomputable with verify_numbers.py.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
authors:
